</div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>Dividing a fraction by another fraction is equivalent to multiplying the first fraction by the reciprocal of the second fraction.</p>\n<p>The reciprocal of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"54\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: red;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mn>2</mn></mstyle><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"55\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: red;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mn>3</mn></mstyle><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mfrac></mstyle><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> So we have</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"56\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cF7\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"3\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: red;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"4\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx